{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"﻿# 《镜中试炼》策划案"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目定位"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"《镜中试炼》是一款横版动作闯关 Demo。玩家在现实层横向推进，清理拦路敌人后遇到镜子门，进入镜中挑战与自身外形相似、能力不同的“镜像自我”。击败镜像后，玩家夺回被封存的能力，并用新能力继续推进。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这个项目不追求完整商业体量，而是追求一个短而完整的可玩闭环：玩家能理解目标、完成战斗、获得能力、感到成长，并在最终挑战中用已经夺回的能力完成综合验证。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目重点展示几件事："}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"chain":""},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"横版动作关卡如何组织推进节奏。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Boss 如何通过招式主题承担教学功能。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家能力如何由 Boss 能力转化而来。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像角色如何复用玩家资源并形成差异。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"战斗、关卡、演出和配置化系统如何串成一个 Demo。"}]}]}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家在被镜子阻断的世界中前进，逐步击败镜中另一个自己，夺回被镜子封存的能力，最终挑战由镜像力量汇聚而成的完整自我。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"核心体验循环"}]},{"type":"extension","attrs":{"extensionType":"com.tencent.iwiki.editor.attachment","extensionKey":"attachment:main","parameters":{"mode":"card","width":800,"height":500,"data":{"id":48816459,"name":"核心体验循环","size":0,"mode":"cos","state":"","src":"/tencent/api/attachments/s3/url?attachmentid=48816459"}},"text":null,"layout":"default","localId":"23041606174148920","annotationId":null,"id":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家每次遇到镜子，都会经历同一个结构："}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"chain":""},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层提供目标和阻力。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜子门阻断前路，提示玩家必须进入镜中。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像 Boss 展示一种被剥离的能力。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家通过观察、规避和反击击败 Boss。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能力回到玩家身上，并改变后续战斗方式。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这个循环的关键不是“打完一个 Boss 发一个技能”，而是让玩家先被某种能力压迫，再通过战斗理解它，最后亲手使用它。能力获得因此既是奖励，也是学习结果。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"核心识别点"}]},{"type":"table","attrs":{"isNumberColumnEnabled":false,"layout":"default","__autoSize":false,"localId":"","isTableAutoScaled":false,"isResizeByScaled":false,"isSelfAdaption":false,"isSelectCelling":false},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"识别点"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"说明"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   镜子是门   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   镜子不是选关 UI，而是挡在关卡前路的地形障碍和叙事节点   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   Boss 是自己   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   Boss 与玩家外形相近，通过颜色、特效、行为和能力区分   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   击败即夺取   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   击败镜像 Boss 后，玩家获得其代表的能力   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   成长来自能力   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   玩家成长不依赖数值升级，而是依赖能力夺回和战斗方式变化   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   最终 Boss 是综合考验   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   最终 Boss 汇合前面已经出现过的能力主题，考验玩家对能力的理解   "}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"故事背景"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"主角进入镜域后，能力被镜子剥离并封存在不同镜像中。每个镜像 Boss 都是主角某部分能力或人格的具象化。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刃镜代表攻击性、锋利感和主动压制；回声代表速度、残影和空间扰动；镜域之主则是这些被剥离部分重新汇合后的完整镜像。玩家击败它们，不是单纯清除敌人，而是在重新拿回自己。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"故事表达要克制，不需要大量文本解释。最重要的是让玩法本身讲清楚这件事：镜子阻断前路，镜像夺走能力，战斗夺回能力，镜子破碎后世界继续向前。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"游戏流程"}]},{"type":"extension","attrs":{"extensionType":"com.tencent.iwiki.editor.attachment","extensionKey":"attachment:main","parameters":{"mode":"card","width":800,"height":500,"data":{"id":48816460,"name":"关卡结构","size":0,"mode":"cos","state":"","src":"/tencent/api/attachments/s3/url?attachmentid=48816460"}},"text":null,"layout":"default","localId":"85966997889497360","annotationId":null,"id":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"整体流程由现实层推进和镜像层 Boss 战交替构成。"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"text","lineWrapping":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层推进\n-> 清理敌人\n-> 镜子门阻挡前路\n-> 进入镜像层\n-> 击败镜像 Boss\n-> 获得能力\n-> 返回现实层\n-> 镜子碎裂并打开前路\n-> 最终镜像层综合考验"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已有流程图可作为宏观结构参考："}]},{"type":"extension","attrs":{"extensionType":"com.tencent.iwiki.editor.attachment","extensionKey":"attachment:main","parameters":{"mode":"card","width":800,"height":500,"data":{"id":48816458,"name":"镜中试炼_游戏流程图","size":0,"mode":"cos","state":"","src":"/tencent/api/attachments/s3/url?attachmentid=48816458"}},"text":null,"layout":"default","localId":"28111811033330180","annotationId":null,"id":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"流程设计的重点是“现实层”和“镜像层”之间的功能分工。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层让玩家往前走，理解当前能力能解决什么问题。镜像层让玩家停下来，集中面对一个能力主题。两者交替出现，就能形成“学习、获得、验证、再学习”的节奏。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"关卡设计方向"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层承担推进、教学和能力验证的作用。整体以横向推进为主，避免复杂分支和过重的平台跳跃负担，让玩家把注意力集中在战斗节奏、敌人组合和镜子门目标上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层的基本节奏是：进入区域、遭遇敌人、清场、获得短暂喘息、接近镜子门。战斗区域可以通过临时边界锁定，清场后解除限制，推动玩家继续向前。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"前段现实层偏向基础操作教学，让玩家熟悉移动、跳跃、闪避和普通攻击。后段现实层提高远程压力和站位压力，让玩家开始使用已夺回的能力解决问题。尾声现实层则减少战斗，更多承担进入最终考验前的情绪过渡。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像层"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像层是 Boss 战空间。每个镜像层都应服务对应 Boss 的能力主题，而不是单纯换一张背景。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刃镜的场地强调横向走位和读招。回声的场地强调拉扯、追击和空间压力。最终镜像层强调综合考验，需要给玩家足够空间使用此前获得的能力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像层视觉上应与现实层明确区分：现实层更稳定、更清晰；镜像层更抽象、更发光、更有破碎感。这样玩家一进入镜中，就能立刻意识到自己进入了规则更集中的试炼空间。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"敌人设计方向"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"影卫"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"影卫是基础近战敌人，用来训练玩家的普通攻击节奏和近距离闪避。它应该行为直接、反馈清楚、被击败成本低，是玩家进入战斗状态的基础练习对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"影卫不需要复杂 AI。它的价值是制造近身压力，让玩家练习攻击、后撤、闪避和清场节奏。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"棱光射手"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"棱光射手是远程敌人，用来训练玩家观察弹道、处理站位和判断击杀优先级。它适合放在后排或高处，迫使玩家主动接近，或使用夺回后的远程能力反制。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"棱光射手的重点是改变战斗空间。它不是靠高强度压制玩家，而是让玩家意识到“站位”和“处理顺序”会影响战斗难度。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"敌人组合原则"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层敌人不追求复杂 AI，而是通过近战压迫和远程干扰形成节奏。关卡中的敌人组合应逐步从简单到混合，让玩家先学会基础操作，再学会根据威胁排序处理敌人。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层的小怪服务于 Boss 和能力获得：在玩家获得镜刃后，远程敌人应该变得更容易处理；在玩家获得回声冲刺后，空间压迫和危险区域应该有更多可规避方式。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家能力与成长"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家初始拥有基础移动、跳跃、闪避和普通攻击。后续成长来自击败镜像 Boss 后夺回能力。"}]},{"type":"table","attrs":{"isNumberColumnEnabled":false,"layout":"default","__autoSize":false,"localId":"","isTableAutoScaled":false,"isResizeByScaled":false,"isSelfAdaption":false,"isSelectCelling":false},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能力"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作用定位"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"获取来源"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   镜刃   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   提供远程攻击手段，用于反制远处敌人和惩罚 Boss 空隙   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   刃镜   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   回声冲刺   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   提供快速位移和规避能力，用于穿越危险区域和制造反击窗口   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   回声   "}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能力获得应有明确演出：Boss 碎裂、镜片汇聚、玩家吸收、能力获得提示、返回现实层、镜子碎裂。这个流程要让玩家感到“我夺回了一部分自己”，而不是只解锁了一个按钮。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能力成长的表达重点是“战斗方式变化”。镜刃让玩家从只能近身处理威胁，变成可以主动处理远处目标。回声冲刺让玩家从被动闪避，变成可以主动穿过危险、调整站位并创造反击窗口。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Boss 设计方向"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"刃镜"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刃镜是玩家遇到的第一个镜像自我，代表被剥离的攻击性和远程压制能力。它的行为应该清晰、直接、有明显预警，让玩家学会观察前摇、闪避攻击并抓住反击窗口。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刃镜不需要复杂招式堆叠。它的重点是让玩家理解“镜刃”这种能力：它可以拉开距离制造威胁，也可以在破绽出现时成为玩家之后的反击工具。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"击败刃镜后，玩家获得镜刃。这个能力应让玩家在后续现实层中明显感到战斗方式发生变化：过去难以处理的远程威胁，现在可以主动反制。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"回声"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"回声代表速度、残影和空间扰动。它不应只靠更快的行动制造难度，而应通过冲刺、残影和延迟威胁让玩家学会管理空间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"回声的设计重点是“位置记忆”。玩家需要注意 Boss 从哪里来、残影留在哪里、危险会在哪里延迟爆发。它训练的不是单纯反应，而是空间判断。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"击败回声后，玩家获得回声冲刺。这个能力应让玩家拥有更主动的位移和规避方式，并为最终 Boss 的高压攻击做准备。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜域之主"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜域之主是前面镜像力量的汇合体，也是玩家对“夺回能力”的最终验证。它不需要完全新增一套陌生能力，而应重组刃镜和回声的能力主题，形成更强的组合压力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"最终 Boss 的重点是综合考验：玩家需要理解镜刃的输出时机，也需要理解回声冲刺的规避价值。战斗体验应强调“用夺回的自己对抗完整的镜像自己”。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜域之主的表现可以更有压迫感，但机制上仍应让玩家看得懂：它使用的东西，玩家此前都见过、学过、夺回过。最终战的爽点来自“我已经会了”，而不是“突然出现完全陌生的规则”。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"能力复用与配置思路"}]},{"type":"extension","attrs":{"extensionType":"com.tencent.iwiki.editor.attachment","extensionKey":"attachment:main","parameters":{"mode":"card","width":800,"height":500,"data":{"id":48816461,"name":"能力复用","size":0,"mode":"cos","state":"","src":"/tencent/api/attachments/s3/url?attachmentid=48816461"}},"text":null,"layout":"default","localId":"89128440609684880","annotationId":null,"id":""}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本项目的技术策划亮点之一，是 Boss 使用的能力和玩家夺回后的能力来自同一套配置思路。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同一个能力可以有不同使用者版本："}]},{"type":"table","attrs":{"isNumberColumnEnabled":false,"layout":"default","__autoSize":false,"localId":"","isTableAutoScaled":false,"isResizeByScaled":false,"isSelfAdaption":false,"isSelectCelling":false},"content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"版本"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设计目标"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   Boss 版   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   前摇清晰，可读可躲，用来教学和压迫玩家   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   玩家版   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   响应更快，反馈更强，用来表达成长和爽感   "}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   敌人版   "}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"background":null,"vertical":null,"cellId":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   行为简单，成本低，方便复用到小怪或关卡机关   "}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这里的重点不是一开始就做大型技能系统，而是从内容组织上避免硬编码：刃镜使用镜刃，玩家击败刃镜后获得镜刃，这两者应该能看出同源关系。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"技术策划亮点"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像角色复用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像 Boss 不需要重新制作完全独立的角色资源。优先复用玩家模型、动画和基础控制结构，再通过材质换色、轮廓光、特效、行为配置和演出包装形成差异。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这样做既符合“Boss 是另一个自己”的主题，也能降低资源制作成本，让项目重点放在玩法结构和系统表达上。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"关卡波次配置化"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现实层战斗不应写死在场景脚本里。敌人组合、出生点、触发条件和清场后事件应尽量配置化，方便调整节奏和复用关卡结构。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"策划调整关卡时，理想状态是修改波次配置、敌人类型和触发关系，而不是频繁改核心代码。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜面切换流程"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜子门是本项目的核心结构节点。它连接现实层、镜像层、Boss 战、能力获得和前路打开。后续实现时应把镜子门做成清晰的流程模块，而不是只做一个场景传送点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜子门至少承担这些表达：它挡住玩家，它提示进入，它把玩家带到镜像层，它在 Boss 被击败后破碎，它让现实层前路重新打开。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"反馈统一"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"技能命中、受击、闪避、Boss 前摇、能力获得等反馈应尽量走统一的反馈配置。这样后续调手感时，可以集中调整动画、特效、音效、镜头震动和顿帧，而不是散落在不同脚本中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"反馈系统不需要一开始做得很大，但需要从第一条可玩切片就保持同一套思路。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"推荐实现范围"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"优先完成一个完整可玩闭环：现实层推进、镜子门、刃镜 Boss、能力获得、返回现实层。这个闭环跑通后，再扩展回声能力、第二段现实层和最终 Boss。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"开发顺序建议："}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"chain":""},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先复用现有平台动作模板，保证玩家移动和基础战斗可用。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先用占位资源表达镜子门、镜像 Boss 和技能特效。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先完成刃镜和镜刃的核心体验。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"再把临时代码整理成轻量 Ability System。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"再扩展回声冲刺、残影、最终 Boss 组合技。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"最后补编辑器、配置校验和答辩展示内容。"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"答辩展示重点"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"答辩时不需要展示大量数值表，而应重点展示以下内容："}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"chain":""},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜子如何把关卡、战斗、成长和叙事串起来。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Boss 如何先展示能力，玩家如何击败后夺回能力。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同一能力如何通过配置区分 Boss 版和玩家版。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"镜像角色如何复用玩家资源并通过表现形成差异。"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"最终 Boss 如何综合考验玩家已经学会的能力。"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"dataHeadingNumber":"","id":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目价值"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"《镜中试炼》的价值在于把“镜子”从视觉主题变成玩法结构。镜子既是门，也是阻碍；镜像既是敌人，也是玩家被剥离能力的化身；击败 Boss 既是战斗胜利，也是成长节点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"最终交付目标是一个结构清晰、可玩可演示、技术策划表达明确的横版动作 Demo。"}]},{"type":"paragraph"}],"version":1}
